Package: consciousnessModelR
Title: Educational Simulations for Consciousness Theories
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person(
        given = "Noushin",
        family = "Nabavi",
        role = c("aut", "cre"),
        email = "37668936+NoushinN@users.noreply.github.com"
    )
Description: Provides simplified educational simulations for exploring major
    consciousness theories, including global workspace theory, information
    integration, attention competition, broadcast dynamics, and threshold-based
    models of awareness-like processing. The package is intended for teaching,
    science communication, conceptual exploration, and portfolio development.
    It does not measure or detect real consciousness.
